  "bio": "Ramoneda Art is an adept tattoo artist based in Barcelona, Spain, renowned for their proficiency in geometric and dotwork styles. Ensuring each design stands as a testament to their creativity and precision, they seamlessly incorporate elements of blackwork with a zest of their art-loving spirit. With an open mind and an enthusiastic approach to their craft, Ramoneda Art invites anyone interested to direct message for more information and to embark on a journey of artistic collaboration.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Barcelona, Catalonia, Spain\n\n• Tattoo • Blackwork • Mural • Graffiti •\n🔥DM for info!!!🔥",
